<title>USA: May Department Stores Co Q4 Feb 1 net up.</title>
<headline>May Department Stores Co Q4 Feb 1 net up.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$1.59		    $1.36</p>
<p> Net			418,000		  362,000</p>
<p> Revs		   4,000,000		3,600,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     258,200		  265,000</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Prior Q4 results includes loss of $31 million or $0.11/shr from discontinued operations. Q4 includes losses of $5 million or $0.02/shr vs $3 million or $0.01/shr on early retirement of debt.  </p>
<p>			YEAR</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$2.84		   $ 2.81</p>
<p> Net			755,000		  762,000</p>
<p> Revs		  11,700,000	     10,484,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     284,100		  265,300</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Prior-year period ended February 3, 1996.</p>
<p>Total revenues (net retail sales plus credit card and interest earned) were $4.1 billion vs $3.8 billion in the Q4 and $12.0 billion vs $11 billion for the full year.</p>
<p>Full-year results include losses of $11 million or $0.04/shr vs $55 million or $0.21/shr from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>	 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
